{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader","doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Prebuilt-UI"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"Overview","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The prebuilt reader has a bookmark button in its navigation bar, and a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Bookmarks screen lists what the user saved. Each bookmark keeps its own"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"copy of the content, so it reopens without a network connection."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Building a custom UI? See "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Adding-a-Bookmark-Button"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The bookmark button needs no setup. To give users a place to find what"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"they saved, add the Bookmarks screen to the carousel as a section, or as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a subsection beside your downloads:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["let carousel = CarouselViewController(","    globalConfig: globalConfig,","    sections: [","        .dynamicArchive(\"Editions\", shortcode: \"SHORTCODE\"),","        .section(.init(name: \"Bookmarks\", type: .bookmarks(type: .all)))","    ]",")"],"syntax":"swift","lineAnnotations":[],"copyToClipboard":true,"showLineNumbers":false,"type":"codeListing","wrap":0},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"bookmarks-screen"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The reader’s bookmark button appears whenever the page on screen has"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"something to bookmark ("},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Adding-a-Bookmark-Button","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" lists what each"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"kind of page saves), and is highlighted once it’s saved. On a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"double-page spread, one tap saves both pages, or removes both when both"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are saved."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The Bookmarks screen lists saved articles and pages, most recently saved"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"first. Tapping one opens its edition at the bookmarked page when the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"edition is downloaded or the device is online; an edition that isn’t"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"downloaded streams, even with “Download while reading” on. Offline with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"no download, the screen opens the saved copies instead, and the user can"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"page through every saved item. The bookmark icon on an item removes it."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In the carousel, the section’s ribbon has a menu that sorts the list by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"save date or edition date, and deletes every bookmark after asking. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"menu appears in a section whose first subsection is Bookmarks or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Downloads."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every screen shares one store of bookmarks, so a bookmark saved in one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reader shows up on every Bookmarks screen."}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Showing-Bookmarks-in-Your-Own-Navigation","text":"Showing Bookmarks in Your Own Navigation"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/BookmarksViewController","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is the same Bookmarks screen for your own"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"navigation. Outside the carousel it has no menu, so give it a sort"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"control of your own through"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/BookmarksViewController\/sortMode-swift.property","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". The chosen order"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"persists across launches."}]},{"lineAnnotations":[],"syntax":"swift","code":["let bookmarks = BookmarksViewController(globalConfig: globalConfig, type: .all)","bookmarks.title = \"Bookmarks\"","bookmarks.navigationItem.rightBarButtonItem = UIBarButtonItem(","    image: UIImage(systemName: \"arrow.up.arrow.down\"),","    menu: UIMenu(children: [","        UIAction(title: \"Recently Saved\") { [weak bookmarks] _ in","            bookmarks?.sortMode = .byBookmarked","        },","        UIAction(title: \"Edition Date\") { [weak bookmarks] _ in","            bookmarks?.sortMode = .byDate","        }","    ])",")","","navigationController?.pushViewController(bookmarks, animated: true)"],"wrap":0,"copyToClipboard":true,"type":"codeListing","showLineNumbers":false},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If a container of yours covers part of the screen, such as a custom tab"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"bar, set "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/BookmarksViewController\/additionalSafeAreaInsets","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" to keep the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"list clear of it."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/FeedReaderViewController","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" has the same bookmark button as the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"carousel’s reader, and the screen shows bookmarks saved there as they’re"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"made."}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Configuring-the-Bookmarks-Screen","text":"Configuring the Bookmarks Screen"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The content type says which bookmarks the screen lists:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/BookmarksConfiguration\/BookmarkType\/feedArticle"},{"text":" and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/BookmarksConfiguration\/BookmarkType\/feedPage"},{"text":" for articles and pages","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"saved from editions on the current system, or ","type":"text"},{"code":".all","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for every kind.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Pass it as ","type":"text"},{"code":"type","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", in the carousel or to ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/BookmarksViewController"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/BookmarksConfiguration","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" styles the screen and sets up the reader it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"opens bookmarks in. Pass one as ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"config"},{"text":" in the carousel, or as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"bookmarksConfig"},{"text":" to ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/BookmarksViewController","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":". Its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/BookmarksConfiguration\/readerConfig","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" starts with copies of your global","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"configuration’s delegates; change it to set up that reader alone:","type":"text"}]},{"lineAnnotations":[],"syntax":"swift","copyToClipboard":true,"code":["var bookmarksConfig = BookmarksConfiguration(globalConfig: globalConfig)","bookmarksConfig.bookmarkedIconColor = .systemOrange","bookmarksConfig.readerConfig.shareDelegate = ShareProvider(sharePolicy: .disabled)","","let bookmarks = BookmarksViewController(","    globalConfig: globalConfig,","    bookmarksConfig: bookmarksConfig,","    type: [.feedArticle, .feedPage]",")"],"wrap":0,"type":"codeListing","showLineNumbers":false},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Theming","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" covers the screen’s colors, labels, and empty state.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The screen opens bookmarks without asking your paywall delegate; see","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Paywalls#Where-the-Prebuilt-UI-Asks","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Replica","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The Bookmarks screen also lists bookmarks saved from replica","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"editions when its type includes","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/BookmarksConfiguration\/BookmarkType\/replicaPage","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/BookmarksConfiguration\/BookmarkType\/replicaArticle","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":", as ","type":"text"},{"code":".all","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" does,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and opens them in the replica reader.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"anchor":"Removing-Bookmarks","level":2,"text":"Removing Bookmarks","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The prebuilt UI keeps its bookmarks in ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/PSEBookmarkManager","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", so your","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"code can reach them. To remove every bookmark when a user signs out:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"lineAnnotations":[],"syntax":"swift","copyToClipboard":true,"code":["PSEBookmarkManager.shared.removeAllBookmarks()"],"wrap":0,"type":"codeListing","showLineNumbers":false},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"In the prebuilt reader, the settings menu’s “Clear edition data” row","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"removes every bookmark along with the downloads; see","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Downloads-and-Offline-Reading#Download-Settings-in-the-Prebuilt-Reader","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Adding-a-Bookmark-Button","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" covers the rest of the manager: listing","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and opening saved items, and observing changes.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Replica","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"te